  - character: {fileID: 166775541}
    useCustomSpeakerName: 1
    customSpeakerName: Sienna
    dialogueText: I know this is a lot to ask of someone who just got here. But somehow
      I feel like you were brought here for a reason!
    useItalic: 0
    useBold: 0
    emotionPortrait: {fileID: -2101606179557248710, guid: 3bbc0cd91b4224547a3088bffc13f955, type: 3}
